menu "OpenShock partition layout migration"

    config OPENSHOCK_MIGRATION_TARGET_VERSION
        string "Firmware version to install after the layout migration"
        default "2.0.0"
        help
            The 1.9.x pivot release rewrites a hub's 1.x partition table into the 2.x layout (components/migration)
            and then installs this version, the first that assumes the 2.x layout.
            Its release must carry each board's partition-table.bin. Ignored by 2.x builds.

endmenu
